    "quote": "Assume that ||θ∗||2 ≤ E and assume that for all t ≥ 1 and for all x ∈ Dt, ||x||2 ≤ X and |<x, θ∗>| ≤ G. Then, for any δ ∈ (0, 1/4], with probability at least 1 − δ, for any n ≥ 0, the regret of the OFUL algorithm is bounded as Rn ≤ 2 max{1, G} sqrt(2nd ln(1 + nX^2/d) max_{0≤t<n} βt(δ))."
   },
